  "title": "Roasted Garlic Potato Soup",
  "description": "This is one of those soups you can&#39;t get enough of. Potatoes are roasted and pureed with chicken broth, onions, garlic and milk for a hearty, creamy soup.",
  "authors": [
    "KATMAC"
  ],
